  6 | good, first                                  | jtimestamptz | t     | 
  7 | good, last                                   | jtimestamp   | t     | 
  7 | good, last                                   | jtimestamptz | t     | 
  8 | infinity                                     | jtimestamp   | t     | 
  8 | infinity                                     | jtimestamptz | t     | 
  9 | -infinity                                    | jtimestamp   | t     | 
  9 | -infinity                                    | jtimestamptz | t     | 
 10 | epoch                                        | jtimestamp   | t     | 
